    <name><text>S3 Q3 — Confirmed balance from listunspent</text></name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<div style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:5px solid #f7931a;border-radius:8px;padding:18px 22px;margin-bottom:16px;">
<p style="color:#9a3412;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 8px;">S3 Q3 — Confirmed balance</p>
<p style="color:#1e293b;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;margin:0;">listunspent returns UTXOs, each with a satoshi amount and a confirmations count.</p>
</div>
<p style="font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;">Write <strong><code>confirmed_balance(utxos, min_conf=6)</code></strong> that sums <code>amount_sat</code> over all UTXOs whose <code>confirmations</code> are at least <code>min_conf</code>. Each UTXO is a dict with keys <code>amount_sat</code> and <code>confirmations</code>.</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html"><text></text></generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>2.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.0000000</penalty>
